How to Run the Application

1. Install the required packages:
    python -m pip install streamlit numpy scikit-learn pillow joblib
2. Open the project folder in the terminal.
3. Run:
    streamlit run app.py
4. Open the local address shown in the terminal.
5. Upload a handwritten digit image and click Predict Digit.

Conclusion

Random Forest achieved the highest accuracy among the three evaluated models. The trained model was integrated into a Streamlit application to demonstrate handwritten digit prediction.